    "name": "Fleet Coordinated Takeoff and Formation (5 Drones) 1",
    "content": "Five-drone coordination exercise: Yard 26, Yard 7, Yard 8, Yard 22, and Yard 9 take off together to 22 meters altitude, then hold formation at positions (519, 381, 22), (532, 445, 22), (833, 454, 22), (652, 660, 22), and (403, 623, 22) respectively for synchronized operation. Then all five drones move north for 74m, and next move east for 79m. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (north 74m, then east 79m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
    "content_aliases": [
      "Coordinate Yard 26, Yard 7, Yard 8, Yard 22, and Yard 9: ascend together to 22 meters, establish pentagon formation at positions (519, 381, 22), (532, 445, 22), (833, 454, 22), (652, 660, 22), and (403, 623, 22) respectively, then execute coordinated movement north 74m followed by east 79m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (north 74m, east 79m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
      "Five-drone formation drill: launch Yard 26, Yard 7, Yard 8, Yard 22, and Yard 9 to altitude 22m, hold stations at (519, 381, 22), (532, 445, 22), (833, 454, 22), (652, 660, 22), and (403, 623, 22) respectively, then shift north by 74 meters and east by 79 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
      "Execute synchronized operation with Yard 26, Yard 7, Yard 8, Yard 22, Yard 9: take off reaching 22 meters height, maintain formation at coordinates (519, 381, 22), (532, 445, 22), (833, 454, 22), (652, 660, 22), and (403, 623, 22) respectively, then proceed north for 74m and subsequently east for 79m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
      "Five-drone coordinated maneuver: Yard 26, Yard 7, Yard 8, Yard 22, and Yard 9 lift off to 22m elevation, hold formation positions at (519, 381, 22), (532, 445, 22), (833, 454, 22), (652, 660, 22), and (403, 623, 22) respectively, then travel north 74 meters and east 79 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
    ],
